<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`PUBLIC_CHANNEL: number = 0`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer PUBLIC_CHANNEL = 0;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PUBLIC_CHANNEL has the value 0x0</p>
  <p>Chat channel that broadcasts to all nearby users & objects. This channel is sometimes referred to as: open chat, local chat and public chat.</p>
  <p>If used with a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlRegionSayTo" target="_blank">llRegionSayTo</a>, it goes to the specified user or prim. Unlike private channels, the user's attachments do not receive the message.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
